Z||000020||BAM-BAM||04-14-2001||12:44 PM||||  So come on now. We aren't going to let this die like so many other good ideas are we? Let give the Aussie our support and encouragement. This is some awesome stuff bro, keep it coming. I'll even volunteer to test fit the scoops/doors on my 85GT with no questions asked  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. I'll be the test bed so to speak. E-Mail me for my addy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. I'll even test the lip spoiler for ya!!!<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!||||reg||6
